! Terminal colours for the recorded demo, so docs/assets/demo.svg sits in the same family
! as the other README pictures: a neutral dark slab that works on either GitHub theme, the
! violet accent on the prompt, green for sure, amber for unsure. Fed to svg-term-cli by
! `make demo-svg` as --term xresources --profile.

*.foreground:  #c3cad6
*.background:  #161b22
*.cursorColor: #9b85ff
*.colorBD:     #f0f2f6

*.color0:      #22272e
*.color1:      #f47067
*.color2:      #4ade80
*.color3:      #fbbf24
*.color4:      #79a9ff
*.color5:      #9b85ff
*.color6:      #56d4dd
*.color7:      #c3cad6
*.color8:      #6b7280
*.color9:      #ff8a80
*.color10:     #86efac
*.color11:     #fcd34d
*.color12:     #a5c8ff
*.color13:     #b9a6ff
*.color14:     #7ee3ea
*.color15:     #f0f2f6
